{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","泼水游戏"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","お湯撒きゲーム"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","恢复周围友军生命，使周围敌人进入睡眠状态。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","周囲の味方のHPを回復し、周囲の敵に睡眠状態を付与"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","用木舀向周围2格区域泼洒温泉水，使命中的友军恢复120% + 10% ATK生命值，对命中的敌人造成140% + 15% ATK伤害并使其进入持续1秒的睡眠状态，睡眠状态下无法行动，目标此前每累计受到相当于其最大生命值10%的治疗效果，或者每累计受到3次来自自身创造温泉区域的治疗，该睡眠状态延长0.5秒，至多延长至3秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","柄杓で周囲2マスに温泉の湯水をばら撒き、ヒットした味方のHPを120% + 10% ATK回復し、ヒットした敵に140% + 15% ATKのダメージを与え、1秒間の睡眠を付与。睡眠状態の敵は行動不能になる。睡眠状態の持続時間は、対象が今回の睡眠状態になるまでの間、下記条件のいずれかを満たすたびに、0.5秒増加、持続時間は最大3秒まで。条件1：受けた回復量がHP上限×10%に達する。条件2：温泉エリアによる回復を3回受ける"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":54,"end":60,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":35,"end":41,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":60,"end":66,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":50,"end":64,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":31,"end":45,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":56,"end":70,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对敌人造成的伤害值提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","敵に与えるダメージが150% + 15% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":10,"end":24,"t