n/cn","战斗开始时向前跳跃，打断周围敌人行动并创造温泉区域。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時に前方へジャンプし、周囲の敵の行動を中断させ、温泉エリアを生成"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时向前跳跃最多3格，猛踩地面打通泉眼，对周围1格敌军造成200% + 20% ATK伤害并附带打断效果，随后使自身周围2格被覆盖为温泉区域，处于温泉区域的友军每秒恢复25% + 2% ATK生命值，处于温泉区域的敌人每秒恢复4% ATK的生命（不超过该敌人0.5%最大生命值）。技能施法期间处于霸体状态。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","戦闘開始時、前方へ最大3マスジャンプし、地面を強く踏んで温泉を湧き上がらせ、周囲1マスの敵に200% + 20% ATKのダメージと中断効果を与える。その後、自身の周囲2マスは温泉エリアになる。温泉エリア内の味方は毎秒、25% + 2% ATKのHPを回復し、温泉エリア内にいる敵は毎秒、4% ATKのHPを回復（毎秒回復量はその敵のHP上限×0.5%を超えない）。スキル発動中、自身はスーパーアーマー状態になる"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":36,"end":42,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":90,"end":95,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":113,"end":118,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":46,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":87,"end":99,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":116,"end":122,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":151,"end":153,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":46,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":110,"end":122,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":144,"end":150,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":193,"end":201,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害值提升至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが220% + 20% ATKにUP"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/